# machine-specific overrides (may contain credentials).
#
# The dotenv family mirrors the mise one: .env.defaults and .env.<env> are
# committed and hold no secrets; the .local layers are yours alone. A bare
# .env is ignored too — nothing reads it as a layer, but Compose picks one
# up automatically for ${...} interpolation, so a stray file should never
# reach the repo.
mise.local.toml
mise.*.local.toml
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# local state
tmp/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# build output
bin/
